WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,700
It's none of my business to move to death.

2
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:09,680
Anyone who dares to take another step forward will be kicked out by me.

3
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:21,420
Don't stand in front of my house, accountant, etc.

4
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:26,840
Didn’t Feng Chuan stay in the house even if he left late?

5
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:30,860
He was sleeping in that snow house, right? There was so much snow so far away.

6
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:31,860
Our wooden houses collapsed

7
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:33,180
There is indeed nothing wrong with his igloo.

8
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:37,140
And I just saw with my own eyes that his face was red when he came out of it, and he was really passive when he took the person who had been frozen all night.

9
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:39,180
Go up the mountain to find Feng Chuan when his father was alive

10
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,020
We are all on a blind date and he is a junior

11
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:42,820
You can't just watch us die, right?

12
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:43,820
Yes, yes, go up
